Author:     Fabricio Breve <fbreve@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: Thu Oct 22 11:57:05 2026 -0300
Commit:     Fabricio Breve <fbreve@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Thu Oct 22 11:57:05 2026 -0300

    Preserve CPU NMI state across savestates
    
    Preserve the normalized three-bit T80 NMI state required for exact savestate replay.
    
    Extend the tagged savestate format to version 12 and restore NMI history with the required Game Gear and DIRSet ordering.
    
    Preserve capture-edge NMI events without duplicating held inputs or allowing pending NMIs to execute prematurely during CPU restoration.
    
    Add accepted-boundary, repeated-load, capture-edge, and real T80 handler regression coverage.

